---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Timeline from '../components/Timeline.astro';
import Card from '../components/Card.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="SYS.LOG.PHILOSOPHY // KRISHNA SONI"
  description="Exposing the systems thinking, horological paradigms, Anthropic developer networks, vegetarian logistics, and rabbit telemetry of Krishna Soni."
>
  <!-- Page Header Dossier -->
  <section class="py-12 border-b border-border-console">
    <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-4">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono text-accent-terminal tracking-widest">// PATH_AND_SYSTEMIC_PHILOSOPHY</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-display font-black tracking-tighter text-white uppercase leading-none">
        Systems design as <span class="text-gradient-terminal font-black">intellectual craft</span>.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-zinc-400 text-xs sm:text-sm font-sans leading-relaxed">
        Building high-performance software requires more than programming syntax; it demands a unified semantic philosophy. This archive tracks the intersections of mathematics, structural horology, Orwellian linguistic clarity, and B2B systems execution.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Interactive Timeline Archive -->
  <section class="py-16 border-b border-border-console relative">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 grid-bg-tactile opacity-10 z-0"></div>
    <div class="relative z-10 mb-12 text-center max-w-xl mx-auto space-y-2">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono text-accent-terminal tracking-widest">[01 // MILESTONES]</span>
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-mono font-bold text-white uppercase mt-1">Ecosystem Evolution</h2>
      <p class="text-zinc-500 text-xs font-sans mt-3 leading-relaxed">
        Tracing the development sequence from foundational computer science engineering nodes to international corporate orchestration.
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <Timeline />
  </section>

  <!-- Foundational Pillars Section -->
  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="mb-12 max-w-xl space-y-2">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono text-accent-terminal tracking-widest">[02 // CORE_PILLARS]</span>
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-mono font-bold text-white uppercase mt-1">Identity & Systems Anchors</h2>
      <p class="text-zinc-500 text-xs font-sans mt-2 leading-relaxed">
        The systemic constructs, horological inspirations, and environmental relationships grounding Krishna's execution loops.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Brutalist Exposed Adjacent Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-0 border-t border-l border-border-console">
      
      <!-- Pillar 1: Mechanical Horology -->
      <div class="border-r border-b border-border-console">
        <Card 
          title="Horological Modularity" 
          tag="Precision" 
          subtitle="Automatic Watches" 
          accent="blue"
          hoverGlow={true}
        >
          <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-zinc-400 mb-6">
            Appreciation for premium **automatic watches** (Seiko, Tissot, Hamilton) drives the architecture of our software components. Mechanical horology features zero microchips—only beautifully coupled 90-degree gears operating in unidirectional harmony.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 font-mono">
            // Blueprints: decoupled Astro components operating as custom chronograph movement gears.
          </p>
        </Card>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 2: Systemic Philosophy -->
      <div class="border-r border-b border-border-console">
        <Card 
          title="Linguistic Entropy" 
          tag="Philosophy" 
          subtitle="Orwell & Crichton" 
          accent="steel"
          hoverGlow={true}
        >
          <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-zinc-400 mb-6">
            Guided by **George Orwell's** critique of linguistic decay and **Michael Crichton's** warnings on chaotic systemic integration. Minimal code translates to clean thoughts. We construct deterministic barriers to block systemic entropy.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 font-mono">
            // Blueprint: "Systemic complexity is the enemy. Build hermetic boundaries to prevent state leakage."
          </p>
        </Card>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 3: Life & Companion -->
      <div class="border-r border-b border-border-console">
        <Card 
          title="Vegetarian & Rabbit" 
          tag="Ecology" 
          subtitle="Nenii Babuu approved" 
          accent="green"
          hoverGlow={true}
        >
          <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-zinc-400 mb-6">
            Committed to an ecological, compassionate **vegetarian lifestyle**. Co-piloting daily systems engineering tasks is **Nenii Babuu**, his rabbit, who serves as a mascot for clean, quiet, and highly focused development operations.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 font-mono">
            // Blueprint: Synchronizing technological synthesis with ecological preservation and quiet focus.
          </p>
        </Card>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
